  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two machines",
      "items": [
        "core owns the role machine and is Qt-free; the controller owns the window",
        "QML reads only Pet.action and Pet.scene, never a state enum",
        "Priority: Idle < Situational < Event < Click < Drag; Study, Ask and Sleep are held states the pet returns to",
        "A nap that ends by itself, or a wake from the budget's sleep, stretches once before idling (ADR 0098)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Wander and hide · ADR 0076",
      "items": [
        "120-300 s of true idle before a stroll; the gait comes from the pet's data (glide, float, hop, trot)",
        "A stroll walks up to two steps with pauses between; a step ending at the work-area edge rolls 70% into a hide",
        "Nothing times a hide out: only a drag out past 0.8 of the width ends it, else it snaps back"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Scenes and signs · ADR 0123 + 0125",
      "items": [
        "PetStage owns the scene lottery, the entry timeline and the frames; the controller only publishes (ADR 0123)",
        "Review answers branch: remembered Celebrate, forgotten Encourage, ignored Angry",
        "Each pet draws its own review sign (ADR 0125); the behavior block tunes the idle odds (ADR 0094)"
      ]
    }
  ]
